Subject: [PATCH 3/4] ARM64: record baseline benchmark results

less has no upstream benchmark, so add benchmarks/run_bench.sh: a
deterministic 1M-line input, a non-tty pipe copy and three scripted
interactive cases (PCRE2 forward search to EOF, backward search from
EOF, -N line numbering to EOF) driven through less_t --tty the same way
lesstest does. Record the native ARM64 MSYS, MSVC ARM64 and emulated
x64 MSYS numbers from a Snapdragon X Elite in base_bench_win_arm.txt
with a metadata sidecar.

Signed-off-by: aswin-mcw <aswin.kalies@multicorewareinc.com>
